  "scope": "Bounded Clause22 read commands only, with temporary MPE and optional CLK-only DIV96 setup/restoration. No PHY writes, packets, DMA, IRQ, clock-controller or reset writes. Fresh private original-FDT decode and live MID/design/selected-source ownership are required, not a historical result. The 200MHz selected-source profile is not an independently measured frequency; division96 gives approximately2.083MHz within the primary MDIO binding's IEEE2.5MHz baseline. NCFGR whole-register ordinary configuration RMW follows macb_set_features; unknown NCR set bits are refused."
